  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "光景bóng uē - 萬能ê門口埕"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8; color: #333;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: #000; font-size: 36px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">萬能ê門口埕</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0;\">/ 李楠崇</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgbTjbbU16THmC7pgwDvZRB9sWKXgxqSuwLmUvFxZX-0jcwo_8twqZNwIO-WZ1gCsQ51nkA3yVSCXxtry5-pmK7L2Phvbw0UH_ObwxNy1Fg01v4n96FIjSnWqHwQkIOjcGwRcf4VGCwyDOGNTVYo9ABUwaWGywMxYp5h9SOKXJR_gotD9nXZLuD8TzdpLjm\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgQbEhjjIELb5fgvvKA6Iul5EsZtKByW6g-rESVWNFB-vbFwUc0TkEL2Xm9RKF6vhn1dmOCP0dxNNKadWkdjWfrmt6AJp5jX3WYk1-VVP_hpi0KOOQLJDkqWepLWE6BQT0JNPnGK6qwD04BSw_hViieF0j7pV8GbLSfrX3d-zAbXOAJ9Zd98mNEmdDh2S_M\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: justify; padding: 0 10px;\">\n        故鄉雲林西螺徛家是正身護龍，大伯蹛龍爿，阮蹛tī虎爿，公廳門頂kuân有漆「隴西衍派」四大字。門口埕是用打馬膠鋪-ê，一年四季曝無仝款ê農作物，tsia mā是tshit-thô、辦桌、nah涼等等ê好所在。<br><br>阮tsit搭是雙冬田，若是佈稻仔，tī 6月冬、尾冬割--起-來，阮兄弟姊妹就開始tàu曝粟仔。日頭赤iānn-iānn，一點鐘內ài kā一稜一稜ê粟仔耙三改，koh ài真tsia̍p趕不時來討食ê粟鳥仔，無閒tshih-tshih koh流汗流khó。序大有huan咐--過，烏雲若到，我就緊大聲huah：「緊--neh--ooh，beh落雨--ah」，親tsiânn五十、厝邊頭尾聽--著，隨tsông來tàu-sann-kāng。粟埕隨tsiânn做戰場，nî-tsînn跤ē-tàng耙、put、掃ê家私，手sa--leh，sī-suā緊kā粟仔收做一大稜，koh khàm大領布篷，硩磚仔角，逐不時hōo天公伯--à凌治kah真忝。<br><br>清明hit跤兜，kā一tsáng一tsáng ê蒜頭tshāi起去鐵架ê竹篙面頂曝日，一層比一層khah kuân，幾若排鐵架bē輸tī-leh埕--裡起樓仔厝仝款。囡仔人齣頭濟，tiānn kā長條ê鐵架內底當做磅空、祕密基地，m̄-nā ē-tàng tī hia做眠夢，koh tshiâng-tsāi做伙sńg bih-sio揣，mā不sám時leh食飽換iau，刁工hōo序大人揣無，tsiah來討皮疼。<br><br>做囡仔ê時，tsit个埕是阮ê遊樂園兼運動埕，拍干樂、tia̍k珠仔、跳索仔、tshiáng跤雞、踢毽子逐項ē，踢銅管仔、搧尪仔標、扮公伙仔真趣味。查埔囡仔上興摃球，摃過去上後壁ê圍牆仔就是hőng-bú-láng，草地生活不止仔樂暢。因為hit-tang-tsūn無做排水系統，見若落大雨，埕--裡隨淹做水池仔，m̄-nā鴨bî仔歡喜kah跳落去sńg水，阮mā sio爭提紙áu船來比看māi，看啥人ê船上在、行上遠，真心適。<br><br>早前嫁娶tshiâng-tsāi tī埕--裡搭布篷，辦桌請人客。若是tī熱--人，幾若支工業用ê電風一直pháng，塗跤koh tshu大塊冰角sio款待，親tsiânn朋友mā是食kah汗tsha̍p-tsha̍p滴。上有記持--ê是，若有人beh標粟仔會ê時，規个埕鬧熱滾滾，主人家ē專工tshuân幾項仔手路菜來請會跤，囡仔mā tuè leh食好料、補喙空，暢kah！<br><br>暗頓若食煞，厝邊兜tiānn ē iap喙食mih仔過家，椅liâu、the椅、蠓仔香tshiâu--出-來，大人ná tām-sám ná <br>phò-tāu，講天講地，iáu有hāu-hia kah飯lē。囡仔ná看天星hām月娘，ná聽序大人講古，秋凊koh快活。<br><br>以早若家己無埕就ài走tsông借埕曝農作物。Hit時tsūn有埕行路就有風。Tsit-tsūn ê門口埕tiānn-tiānn無人踏跤到koh lio̍h仔稀微——作穡人五穀收成就tī田--裡交hōo販仔，m̄免載tńg來埕--裡曝；囡仔bih tī厝sńg手機仔，m̄願出來外口sńg；喜事ài tī大餐廳辦khah tshia-iānn koh省事事省——tsit个埕tsit-má kan-na賰停自家用--ê、曝衫、老人nah日ê功能。<br><br>埕斗起好到tann，beh倚50个春夏秋冬，壁面有lio̍h仔lak漆，我tsit-má坐tī涼亭仔跤，猶原有鳥仔贊聲，日頭仝款真iām，íng過ê hi-hi-huā-huā kah光彩，hōo我siàu念bē煞。Hiàng時ê往事，一幕一幕tshiâng-tsāi<br> tī我面頭前搬演。<br>\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border: 1px solid #eeeeee; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgcaJA6N1ZrqgmRUKUpwRw_bfFGnWPXE-oN4zAE4h4X2M64Aed3YCoqI1GA9YW53DORyrqM-REyDAMwEw82xn7QZcPCJs4Lywf0ZbrOVcFMVSHNVJPpN1ttnKE3Dmr-sydbgQFcHB67mwVOPp_mioP1mq3U0EWv-41HqZyvzNWeXu7LTU1dImdfZD8ZeE-K\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 389期，2026年08月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br>\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br>\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
